type: software
title: "Tabular ML Lab"
abstract: "An interactive research workbench that takes tabular data from upload to a manuscript-ready starting point: guided exploratory analysis, feature engineering and selection, model comparison with bootstrap confidence intervals, explainability, sensitivity analysis, and a generated LaTeX manuscript draft with a TRIPOD checklist."
